Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.25,0:00:05.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This one's rare. This one's mediumwell. Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.25,0:00:05.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是三分熟  这是五分熟  快去上菜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.98,0:00:07.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Phoebe! How was dinner?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.98,0:00:07.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比  晚餐好吃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.70,0:00:11.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dinner was good! Just saying hi! Now I'm gonna go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.70,0:00:11.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}晚餐很好吃  我只是来打招呼  我要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.35,0:00:14.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.35,0:00:14.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.25,0:00:18.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't see this on the menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.25,0:00:18.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在菜单上没看到这道美味
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.10,0:00:19.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tim, this is Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.10,0:00:19.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}提姆  她是菲比
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.86,0:00:21.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Phoebe, this is Tim, my new sous chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.86,0:00:21.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比  他是新来的副厨师长提姆
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.09,0:00:24.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} So you're Monica's boss?  No, she's my boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.09,0:00:24.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是莫妮卡的老板  不  她是我的老板
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.73,0:00:26.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Sous" is French for "under."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.73,0:00:26.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"副"在法文里是"之下"的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.13,0:00:28.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I "sousstand."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.13,0:00:28.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我副（明）白了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.84,0:00:31.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tim, I need a calamari and a caesar salad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.84,0:00:31.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}提姆  我要一份乌贼跟一份凯撒沙拉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.77,0:00:33.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And could you get me the pesto?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.77,0:00:33.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以把青酱递给我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.90,0:00:36.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} You made pesto?  Yes, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.90,0:00:36.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}青酱是你做的吗  没错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.72,0:00:39.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Would you say your pesto is the besto?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.72,0:00:39.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得你的青酱是最"棒"的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.99,0:00:43.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. I would say it's pretty goodo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.99,0:00:43.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道  我会说它真的很"强"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.23,0:00:48.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I still need the calamari and salad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.23,0:00:48.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别忘了给我拿乌贼跟沙拉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.54,0:00:49.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I like your necklace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.54,0:00:49.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢你的项链
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.83,0:00:52.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} I made it myself.  You are so talented.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.83,0:00:52.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是我自己做的  你真的好有天份
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.15,0:00:54.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, it's no pesto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.15,0:00:54.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还是不够"酱"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.34,0:00:57.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Alright, alright. Let's just cut to the chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.34,0:00:57.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们就别兜圈子了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.12,0:00:59.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. You're single. You're single.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.12,0:00:59.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是单身  你也单身
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.13,0:01:02.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He gets off work at 11. She'll be waiting for your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.13,0:01:02.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他11点下班  她会等你的电话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.20,0:01:04.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll give him your number if I could just get
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.20,0:01:04.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会把你的电话号码给他
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.07,0:01:06.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}one calamari and one caesar salad!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.07,0:01:06.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只要你给我乌贼跟凯撒沙拉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.29,0:01:12.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I did not yell. I am not putting a dollar in the jar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.29,0:01:12.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有大叫  我不必被罚一块钱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.08,0:01:16.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Friends S08E05 The One With Rachel's Date
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.08,0:01:16.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《老友记》  第八季  第5集  瑞秋的约会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.28,0:01:57.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow, Bing! Burning the midnight oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.28,0:01:57.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}宾  你还在熬夜加班
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.87,0:01:59.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.87,0:01:59.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你很了解我的  老板
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.39,0:02:01.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I do have a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.39,0:02:01.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我正好有个问题问你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.77,0:02:04.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you know how I can get around the office computer network...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.77,0:02:04.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道要怎么避开公司的电脑网路
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.06,0:02:06.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so I can access the really good Internet porn?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.06,0:02:06.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看劲爆火辣的国际黄片吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.68,0:02:10.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're a joker, Bing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.68,0:02:10.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真爱开玩笑  宾
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.09,0:02:13.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's funny about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.09,0:02:13.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那有什么好笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.39,0:02:16.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry I kept you waiting so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.39,0:02:16.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉让你等这么久
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.80,0:02:19.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's okay. Where do you wanna go?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.80,0:02:19.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没关系  你想去哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.79,0:02:21.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think you know where I wanna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.79,0:02:21.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以为你知道我要去哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.91,0:02:23.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} The Hard Rock Cafe?  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.91,0:02:23.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}硬石餐厅  对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.01,0:02:26.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Again?  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.01,0:02:26.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}又要去  对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.50,0:02:30.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm telling you, I like the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.50,0:02:30.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的很喜欢那里的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.43,0:02:32.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You like the Purple Rain display.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.43,0:02:32.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是喜欢那里的紫雨展示品
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.55,0:02:37.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Hey, Bob.  Hey, Toby. Have a good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.55,0:02:37.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}巴伯  托比  祝你今晚玩得开心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.74,0:02:40.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did that guy just call you Toby?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.74,0:02:40.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那家伙叫你托比
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.69,0:02:43.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, he thinks that's my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.69,0:02:43.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  他以为那是我的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.62,0:02:46.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't you correct him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.62,0:02:46.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么不更正他
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.14,0:02:48.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's been going on way too long now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.14,0:02:48.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在纠正有点太晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.24,0:02:51.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The first time he said it, we were just passing each other in the hallway,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.24,0:02:51.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他第一次这么叫我  我们只是在走廊擦肩而过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.63,0:02:52.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}so I didn't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.63,0:02:52.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我什么都没说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.69,0:02:55.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The next time he said, "Hey, Toby, want a doughnut?"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.69,0:02:55.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}第二次他说"托比  你要吃甜甜圈吗"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.25,0:02:58.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wanted the doughnut.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.25,0:02:58.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我确实想吃甜甜圈
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.25,0:03:03.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Five years later, the doughnut's gone and I'm still Toby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.25,0:03:03.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}五年后甜甜圈早就消化光了 我还是托比
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.03,0:03:06.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Five years. Chandler, you have to tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.03,0:03:06.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}五年了  钱德勒  你得告诉他
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.18,0:03:08.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. That would be so awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.18,0:03:08.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行  那多尴尬啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.23,0:03:11.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Besides, we don't work together. He's on the sixth floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.23,0:03:11.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再说  我们不在同一个楼层工作  他在六楼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.42,0:03:13.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So he calls me Toby once in a while. What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.42,0:03:13.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他只是偶尔才会叫我一次托比  没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.97,0:03:16.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It could be worse. It's not like he's calling me Muriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.97,0:03:16.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这已经算不错了  反正他不是叫我妙丽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.02,0:03:21.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Muriel. Why would he call you Muriel?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.02,0:03:21.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妙丽  他为什么要叫你妙丽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.84,0:03:27.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.84,0:03:27.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.98,0:03:31.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chandler "M." Bing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.98,0:03:31.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德勒·M·宾
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.99,0:03:37.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not just an "M." Your middle name is Muriel!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.99,0:03:37.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不仅是个M  你的中间名是妙丽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.61,0:03:40.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It is a family name.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.61,0:03:40.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是家族名字
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.77,0:03:44.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chandler Muriel Bing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.77,0:03:44.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德勒·妙丽·宾
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.87,0:03:49.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your parents never even gave you a chance, did they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.87,0:03:49.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你父母真是完全不给你留活路  对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.51,0:03:54.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Drake, I've discovered the reason for your memory loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.51,0:03:54.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}德瑞克  我找出你丧失记忆的原因了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.99,0:03:56.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.99,0:03:56.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.06,0:03:59.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Apparently your brain transplant was not entirely successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.06,0:03:59.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的脑部移植手术并未完全成功
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.38,0:04:02.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It seems your body's rejecting Jessica's brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.38,0:04:02.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的身体在排斥洁西卡的脑部
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.37,0:04:03.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is it serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.37,0:04:03.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很严重吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.74,0:04:07.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not if we extract tissue from the original body...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.74,0:04:07.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我们可以从捐赠者的身体抽取组织...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.48,0:04:10.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and synthesize antibodies and introduce them to your system
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.48,0:04:10.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}合成抗体  将其导入你体内
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.22,0:04:12.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}which could stop you from rejecting the brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.22,0:04:12.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以此来解除排异效应
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.53,0:04:16.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That sounds simple enough. Let's just do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.53,0:04:16.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听起来很简单  我们就按你说的做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.11,0:04:18.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We would,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.11,0:04:18.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们可以那么做
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.20,0:04:20.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but when we went to exhume Jessica's body...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.20,0:04:20.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我们想挖出洁西卡的尸体时
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.38,0:04:22.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...it was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.38,0:04:22.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}发现它不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.74,0:04:27.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.74,0:04:27.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}卡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.79,0:04:29.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Very nice, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.79,0:04:29.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}非常不错  大伙们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.64,0:04:31.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, let me just get changed and we can go to dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.64,0:04:31.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我换好衣服后  我们就可以去吃晚餐了
